    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior Duels</strong> is an immersive online trading card game that pits two legendary warriors from distinct historical factions against each other in a duel of skill, strength, and strategy.\u00a0 Choose from preconstructed decks or build your own, play against opponents from around the world, or challenge the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior Duels is completely free with built-in tutorials to teach the game mechanics.\u00a0 Simple to learn, challenging to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559960/extras/7d92d33653b8e5a8e028e1d9405c7c67.avif?t=1742836467\" width=790 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 different warriors, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom decks with powerful attacks, defenses, and tactical cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver your opponent with skillful card combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make attacks concealed, unblockable, or undodgeable to avoid defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used tactical cards that favor your faction's skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559960/extras/bc4718d0e440c3f2caa33394bbd9d65e.avif?t=1742836467\" width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven different factions offer unique gameplay each having different strengths.\u00a0 Barbarians are attack focused with little regard for defenses.\u00a0 The Ninja relies on concealment and sneak attacks, the Samurai uses lightning quick attacks and defenses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current factions include: Barbarian, Knight, Legionnaire, Ninja, Samurai, Sword Master, and Viking</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addition factions coming in future sets!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warrior Duels</strong> is an immersive online trading card game that pits two legendary warriors from distinct historical factions against each other in a duel of skill, strength, and strategy.\u00a0 Choose from preconstructed decks or build your own, play against opponents from around the world, or challenge the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior Duels is completely free with built-in tutorials to teach the game mechanics.\u00a0 Simple to learn, challenging to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559960/extras/7d92d33653b8e5a8e028e1d9405c7c67.avif?t=1742836467\" width=790 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 different warriors, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom decks with powerful attacks, defenses, and tactical cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver your opponent with skillful card combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make attacks concealed, unblockable, or undodgeable to avoid defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used tactical cards that favor your faction's skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559960/extras/bc4718d0e440c3f2caa33394bbd9d65e.avif?t=1742836467\" width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven different factions offer unique gameplay each having different strengths.\u00a0 Barbarians are attack focused with little regard for defenses.\u00a0 The Ninja relies on concealment and sneak attacks, the Samurai uses lightning quick attacks and defenses.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current factions include: Barbarian, Knight, Legionnaire, Ninja, Samurai, Sword Master, and Viking</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addition factions coming in future sets!</p></li></ul>",
